@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Local-only source site core rehearsal
+
+This is an incomplete, nondeployable review candidate. It changes runtime imports and package manifests to the unpublished `@krigsvold/core` and private Astro 2.0.0 tarballs while preserving historical public `/theme` installation guidance. The existing lockfile still describes the released packages and must be replaced after approved `/core` and Astro publication; no machine-specific tarball lock is suitable for commit. Existing public distribution and generated agent records remain historical and require a separate carefully reviewed update after release.
+
+The source-site GitHub Actions workflow is verification-only, but external Cloudflare preview triggers cannot be enumerated from this environment. Do not push this branch, create a site PR, merge, or deploy until the preview triggers are verified not to deploy. Deployment requires separate authorization. Local builds use explicit tarballs and do not prove deployment readiness.
+
+The immutable source-shell snapshot retains its historical `@krigsvold/theme/legacy.css` import. The local candidate maps only that specific CSS path to the byte-equivalent core legacy stylesheet in its build and shell generator. This is not an npm alias and does not satisfy an Astro peer; the old snapshot/provenance is unchanged.
+
+At this local candidate, the full site unit tests and token generation passed and a direct Astro root build succeeded with locally installed tarballs; the full `npm run build` failed at its pinned React-reference fetch with DNS `EAI_AGAIN`; no checksum assertion was bypassed. An Astro `/preview` build completed but local-link verification failed because existing site links are root-relative. Do not treat this as subpath-ready. The npm lockfile is intentionally not updated with an unpublishable local path. Public download, generated agent and historic provenance references require coordinated review before any release.
